#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557232"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF loomed ahead.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF immediately prepares to engage in combat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559428"
msgid "If anyone is hopeful of her future,\nit's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF herself. No one is capable of\ninterfering with how she lives. No one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561684"
msgid "Having lost her composure, she clutches #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\nShe looks nothing like the dauntless Game Champ."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561856"
msgid "We're going to end this now.\nWe'll end it all.\nEven if we lose―――or win!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562148"
msgid "Regardless, you think I'm hopeless,\ndon't you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562248"
msgid "That's right, I'm hopeless!\nSo just go on and kill me! I'm not afraid,\nI mean, everyone dies in the end!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562364"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562596"
msgid "In that case…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "562612"
msgid "I want you to tell Gatou, \"thanks.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562652"
msgid "…………!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562668"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's face turns pale."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562796"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF, accept Praetor's sympathy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563452"
msgid "I won't say it……!\nI'll never say it!\nI'll never EVER say it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563524"
msgid "It's not my fault that the old man died!\nHe was dead from the very beginning!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563840"
msgid "Haa, aah, ahh―――\nAhh, ah―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563876"
msgid "…ah… enough…\nI've had enough,\nI don't need anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563940"
msgid "#C236196003KARNAAA#CDEF!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565212"
msgid "―――Guh―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565360"
msgid "That was definitely a fatal wound.\nEven if he's a Servant, he won't be able\nto avoid fading if this goes any further―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565676"
msgid "W-what are you so impressed about, Praetor!?\nE-even I can do that! I can revive THRICE!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566332"
msgid "…which leaves one person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566364"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566380"
msgid "The only person left is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, dazed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566700"
msgid "A-ah…\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566756"
msgid "I lock with her startled and anticipatory gaze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566808"
msgid "I mustn't hesitate.\nI'm going to lay #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind bare.\nIf I don't, then we won't move on, she won't move on…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567408"
msgid "…sorry.\nIt's okay to hate me forever.\nI'll always hate myself, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567484"
msgid "But this is probably a good thing…\nIt's fine if you and I don't know what\nour futures hold…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567776"
msgid "Thankfully―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568004"
msgid "……hehehehehe…\nHere you are… So at last you came, eh?\nThis is the final stage…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568340"
msgid "Yes. It's all coming together.\nThe carefully calculated…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568852"
msgid "Huh? Synchronized with #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nMe?\n……………why?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568928"
msgid "………why? That's what I want to ask.\nApparently, #C236196003BB#CDEF hasn't tampered with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569200"
msgid "I-I ain't hopeless!\nIsn't this normal!?\nI mean, #C236196003BB#CDEF's side has the better value!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569476"
msgid "Doesn't matter to me if everyone's got problems.\nNah, making problems for people is a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF's\njob. This here is a dead-end for you."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "570208"
msgid "Compulsive Liar"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570464"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind may seem weak enough to beat easily,\nbut let's focus and choose correctly―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570588"
msgid "……hmph.\nYou like 'em big?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570796"
msgid "C-compulsive Liar!? Rude, yo!\nI'm no lia―――\nKyaaAaa!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571248"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF must've enticed her to \"lock #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF away\nalong with herself as a last resort.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571600"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is the liar."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "571960"
msgid "Loneliness"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572184"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572288"
msgid "O-oh, cool… Sorry for saying something so mean…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572596"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is afraid of――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572652"
msgid "Kyaaaa……!\nWh… what! I'm not scared!\nI may be lonely, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572736"
msgid "Lonely, really…\nLonely… that's like… uugh…\n*sob*… waaaaahhhh!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572940"
msgid "…I can't stand this anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573096"
msgid "If I identify it, then I can finally\nstrip this facade out of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573644"
msgid "You can join stuff together, but that doesn't\nmean it's alright to pair stuff together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573860"
msgid "Gwaaaaaaah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574380"
msgid "Haa, kgh…!\nAhh… ahh, ah―――\nHaa, ah…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574520"
msgid "I'm butt-naked…\nI can't hide my pitiful,\nshameful self any… more…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574688"
msgid "Yeah, that'll do it!\nI didn't ask you or that old man #C236196003Gatou#CDEF\nfor help, anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574808"
msgid "Leave me alone already!\nI'm going to die here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575012"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's compulsive lying is an #C000246204SG#CDEF that deceives even herself.\nOnly a barrage of attacks can defeat her now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575264"
msgid "HYOOWWW!?\nAwawa! Sorry, sorry, MY BAD!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575348"
msgid "B-but what else was I supposed to do!?\nI don't know what I should do!\nI'm just a NEET!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575480"
msgid "I don't think that counts as a NEET…\nAwawa! Sorrysorry! I'm sure there are\nNEETs like that out there!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575584"
msgid "But that's not what I am!\nBefore I even realized it, I turned into this!\nNo one will love someone like me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576340"
msgid "Hyow…!? No!\nDon't go shoving some rod in between…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576564"
msgid "Haa… haa… haa…\nUgh… Getting yelled at, getting complimented―\nI feel like a mess…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576656"
msgid "But… I can tell that you really are\nmad at me, frustrated with me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577020"
msgid "…#C236196003Jinako#CDEF sounds more serious than she has been."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577400"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577560"
msgid "Hic… uuuggghhh…!\nYou don't get it… You completely, absolutely,\nhaven't the slightest clue!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577796"
msgid "Ah…!\nHaa―――It, tingles―――\nIt hurts, but it feels, good―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577872"
msgid "Don't be, so hard, on myself―――\nThat's it?\nIs that, okay―――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577948"
msgid "…yeah.\nI think #C236196003Jinako#CDEF forgot that one, simple thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578576"
msgid "HYAAAWWAAAA!\nNo! If I take any more of this,\nI'll go CRAZY!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578832"
msgid "#C080080080…she sounded a little desperate at the end there,\nbut that much bluntness fits #C236196003Jinako#CDEF#C080080080 just fine.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579128"
msgid "#C080080080…I'm glad.\nI didn't do it perfectly, but I managed to pass the\nbaton from #C236196003Gatou#CDEF#C080080080 to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF#C080080080―――#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579636"
msgid "Now I'm going into my REAL boss mode.\n…hmph. How about I stick you in a neeeeeever\nending command battle…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579752"
msgid "The world is growing dark…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579832"
msgid "…now there's no way out.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's words failed to reach her―――"
msgstr ""

