#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636520"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636624"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636760"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636804"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636944"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637064"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637164"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637356"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637420"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637500"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637616"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637744"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637788"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637916"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638044"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638152"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638240"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638332"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638480"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638564"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638696"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638796"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638956"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639084"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639176"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639308"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639408"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639616"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639740"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639872"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639964"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640088"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640168"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640272"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640360"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "640480"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "640564"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "640644"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "640712"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "640752"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "640784"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640816"
msgid "Despite being inside the Core of the Labyrinth,\nthe depths of her mind, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is nowhere to be found."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640936"
msgid "Here you are, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nIt's disappointing, but this is where you and\nI say our farewells, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641052"
msgid "Here you are, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nIt's disappointing, but this is where you and\nI say our farewells, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641168"
msgid "Here you are, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nIt's disappointing, but this is where you and\nI say our farewells, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641284"
msgid "Here you are, #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF.\nIt's disappointing, but this is where you and\nI say our farewells, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641408"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF. No, out of respect for your Master,\nI suppose you're #C236196003Launcher#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641512"
msgid "I also feel disappointed.\nIt pains me greatly to battle it out with\none when there is no need."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641608"
msgid "Hmph. There's no other Servant around\nworth fighting less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641668"
msgid "No hostility, yet your guard is steel and you\nshoulder no pride. There's this king, another\ngoldie, that I want to have learn from you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641804"
msgid "Oh, we haven't met in quite a while.\nYour Master declared she didn't need little old\nyou, yet you still faithfully follow her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641932"
msgid "I've come for your head, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\nTime to make good on what you committed to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642028"
msgid "Even more so for the golden Heroic Spirit.\nThough I had wished to draw my chariot and clash\nagainst you over the sunset tumult of war…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642164"
msgid "This, too, is fate. If you'll think of your lord\nand retreat with dignity, then fine. If you'll\nprotect your lord until the end, that's fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642308"
msgid "How magnificent, rose emperor.\nI'm certain many of your people lauded your\nlifestyle, but I see only tragedy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642420"
msgid "But listen, Heroic Spirit of charity.\nIs this battle really necessary? Isn't there\nsomeone ELSE that needs admonishing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642540"
msgid "Keep to your own affairs, don't speak of mine.\nYou have a bad habit of meddling with those you\nsee as good―be they friend or foe, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642696"
msgid "I'll just say this: your over-protectiveness is\nmuch too genuine. One can believe in another's\nfuture, but to some, that's simply a burden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642836"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is one of those people.\nDon't you understand that the more you try to\ndo right, the more you pressure your Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642976"
msgid "You're the one lacking prudence.\nAlso, I'm not a just Heroic Spirit,\nand I never expected anything from #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643104"
msgid "Or perhaps you'll plead for your life? Go ahead.\nI'm generous and am especially compassionate\ntowards those with the value of gold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643236"
msgid "Will it be your armor? Lance? Head?\nI had told you to sacrifice any one to me.\nThe conditions haven't changed, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643352"
msgid "You're voraciously insatiable.\nWith such a fortune as yours, you yet still\ndesire more, new treasure?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643456"
msgid "…well, I understand how you feel.\nAs you know, this head of mine isn't even\nworth a pittance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643552"
msgid "Anything and everything you do has to be\non stage, so much so that your life is\nfilled with despair and sorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643664"
msgid "…it would be apt to say that our feelings\nare mutual. I understand your agony well;\neven what you wanted to save."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643780"
msgid "You're the one who's admonishing the wrong\nperson. You consider the order \"justice\" to be\ngood, yet you seek to be an ally of the weak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643916"
msgid "That probably goes for you, too.\nKeeping close to your Master is what you deem\nfine; not protecting or guiding them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644036"
msgid "Even if that results in nothing for you,\nyou won't go and change that outcome out of\nselfishness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644136"
msgid "This might not be worth it to you\nunless you take my armor or my lance――\nBut you'll have to give up on those."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644248"
msgid "I already pledged my armor away.\nThat said, I also need this lance\nto fulfill my promise to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644348"
msgid "I shall lower the curtains on you, #C236196003Saber#CDEF.\nOnce the leading actor disappears,\nthe stage will go with them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644472"
msgid "Do you realize the contradiction, weak one?\nIf you can't kill your emotions,\nthen at least stop championing justice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644592"
msgid "Although, several of your desires do ooze\nout when you speak. Which means you're truly a\npure fox, who sacrifices for her Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644724"
msgid "So in the end, all that remains is my head.\nSo you'll have to settle with taking it.\n――Of course, that's only if you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644848"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF stands firm like the stern,\nchief butler of a mansion.\nHe regards us as enemies, yet\nmaintains his courtesy.\nHis serenity overwhelmingly intimidates us back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645028"
msgid "…#C236196003Jinako#CDEF herself is well aware that she\nmustn't continue hiding any longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645120"
msgid "The reality is that your Master became strong\nover a short time. I'm not speaking of martial\nstrength, but mental fortitude."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645248"
msgid "#[His][Her]# unparalleled, peerless tenacity to advance\nthrough the Labyrinth likely appears to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nas a repulsive threat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645392"
msgid "#[He][She]# is a contrast to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, whose #C000246204SGs#CDEF have\nbeen pulled apart, and is now completely\nparalyzed by a vague fear dominating her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645560"
msgid "Yet that's not the end of it―――\nLike a cool flame, there's one thing that's\ngradually scorching her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645672"
msgid "―――\"Her guilt, I suppose.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645704"
msgid "I murmur, to which #C236196003Karna#CDEF nods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645752"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is trapped by a guilty conscience that\nstabs at her, and regret over being abandoned\nby #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, whom she hates endlessly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645920"
msgid "I'm grateful to #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nMy Master was in the depths of madness, and he\nwas just barely able to stop her because――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646052"
msgid "STOOPPP ITTT!\nThe hell, man!? Am I being publicly executed!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646116"
msgid "Why won't you hurry your ass up and\ndo your Servant thing!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646176"
msgid "I really really REALLY got the shit end of the\nstick with this Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646248"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF makes her appearance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646296"
msgid "…although, her looks never made any\nclaim to that title in the first place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646376"
msgid "We gonna fight, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nIf it'll end this, then let's do it.\nThere's no other choice!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "646480"
msgid "No. I won't play along with your desperation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646528"
msgid "So what then!?\nYou barge into people's minds for the hell\nof it!? Talk about the ultimate stalker!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646628"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is still fixated on death.\nHer survival instincts are waning beyond control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646728"
msgid "Even if we fight, this won't turn out well―――\nWin or lose, the result will be #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nbeing battered between her weakness and powerlessness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646888"
msgid "Mhm. I knew you would find the words, Praetor.\nIt's simple and straightforward, but that's\nwhat makes it a fantastic reply!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647012"
msgid "That's the path that will lead away from battle.\nLead to where you need to return to, where the\nallies you need to depend on are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647144"
msgid "This will be so much easier if you just\nadmit it. Aren't you a stubborn one?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647224"
msgid "―――Now I see.\nThat detail had escaped me. Certainly, one's\nexploits do beget words of appreciation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647328"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF isn't forcing you to dance to her will.\nHer sweet words are like wine in a lead\nchalice―sweet poison that will destroy you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647472"
msgid "Enough with being entranced with meaningless\ndeath. Even if you gain nothing from that path,\nno one will laugh at your struggle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647604"
msgid "Not that it matters to me.\nI'll use my true strength to make you submit.\nAfter all…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647692"
msgid "You like it when it hurts, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647732"
msgid "Gratitude is given between you and the other.\nIf you don't put into words which part of that\nman was rare, you won't understand him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647868"
msgid "No matter what we do―――\nNo matter what we do,\nnothing will save us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647940"
msgid "Even if we mourn at this point, nobody's time\nwill turn back; not for papa or mama, not for\nme, not for that annoying old man!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648068"
msgid "I won't disappear.\nI won't go outside. I'll stay here forever\nand ever, and IT'LL BE FINE!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648160"
msgid "Get them the HELL OUT!\nDon't let them come back ever again!\nWIPE THEM OFF THE FACE OF THIS EARTH!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648260"
msgid "…if that's your order, then I shall obey.\nBy the tyranny of my spear, I shall reduce\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF to cinders."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648392"
msgid "If the dark fire within #RUBS   you #RUBE#C236196003Jinako#CDEF#REND says it won't go\nout until it burns #RUBS   you #RUBE#C236196003Jinako#CDEF#REND down, then I shall\nbecome a mantle to block the wind and rain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648608"
msgid "Have at you, #SVT[#C236196003Saber#CDEF][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][#C236196003Caster#CDEF][#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF]#.\nKnow that this place beds your premature death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648780"
msgid "Have at you, #SVT[#C236196003Saber#CDEF][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][#C236196003Caster#CDEF][#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF]#.\nKnow that this place beds your premature death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648952"
msgid "Have at you, #SVT[#C236196003Saber#CDEF][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][#C236196003Caster#CDEF][#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF]#.\nKnow that this place beds your premature death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649124"
msgid "#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF.\nKnow that this place beds your premature death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649204"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF took a full blow to the\nchest from #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, yet doesn't fall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649304"
msgid "…I shudder at the sight of his spirit, his endurance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649360"
msgid "Yet after taking such a blow, #C236196003Karna#CDEF still stands.\nIt isn't due to some healing skill or immortality skill.\nIncredibly, by the mere strength of his will,\nhe's \"enduring\" a fatal wound…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649564"
msgid "What kind of monster are you? Is this some\nmagic, overwriting the laws of physics? Or is\nyour willpower deferring the laws of physics?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649700"
msgid "…do you understand what you're doing?\nDo you think it's okay for one related to the\ngods to be trampling over the laws of nature?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649832"
msgid "Like a zombie. He's not a Heroic spirit who\nrefuses to die when killed. Rather, he's a fool\nprepared to not die until the time is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649972"
msgid "―――That's enough.\nNow that I've witnessed this,\nI no longer desire your head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650056"
msgid "Not having that golden armor is regrettable,\nbut I see collecting it would be difficult.\n…go, as you see fit and wish to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650180"
msgid "I bet it's taking everything just for him to breathe.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF doesn't respond."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650276"
msgid "…she lost #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, and #C236196003Karna#CDEF was completely defeated.\nIt's evident how far backed into the corner #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650436"
msgid "But that doesn't mean we can go easy on her.\nIf showing her pity results in #C236196003Jinako#CDEF slipping away,\nno good will have come from any of this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650592"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is struck by a sharp blow.\nThe head of the immense lance smoothly slices through flesh,\nannihilating the Spiritron contract linking #C236196003#SVT#CDEF―\nlinking #SVT[her][him][her][him]# and #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650840"
msgid "The battle is over.\nYour drive wasn't enough to make up for the\ngap between your ability and mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650940"
msgid "…I'm also disappointed, but it is what it is.\nIf any more foreign bodies enter #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind,\nit'll collapse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651068"
msgid "Go peacefully.\nI praise you two for your endeavor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651120"
msgid "Compared to going back to that cruel\nslaughter-fest, disappearing inside of me is a\nhundred times better, isn't it…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651240"
msgid "I can't hear #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's voice very well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651296"
msgid "The lance blazes with high heat,\nand my body grows cold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651356"
msgid "Without the chance to experience pain,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's soul burns out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651444"
msgid "Like a something-something to a flame.\nMy masterful performance paid off!\nI'm literally a tactician…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651548"
msgid "Throughout the dim space,\na strangely energetic voice echoes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651612"
msgid "It's definitely #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's voice,\nbut this baseless confidence,\nthis careless and obliviously made statement―\nWas she really―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651760"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF-sponsored,\n\"Capture #C236196003#NICK#CDEF, and I'll Promote You\nto Queen of the Moon Campaign.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651876"
msgid "I cleared the event,\nand didn't even break a sweat.\nThere's nowhere to run, now, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651980"
msgid "I turn around in the darkness,\nand a distinct \"mental wall\" comes into view."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652060"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF isn't joking.\nThis is just like back with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nSo, a part of #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind was synchronized with #C236196003BB#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652260"
msgid "Which means that everything that happened\nup until now, and her defiance in lieu of the situation,\nwas all of her own accord."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652388"
msgid "What a…\nWhat a hopeless thirty-year-old #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652460"
msgid "Let me just say this: I've done nothing wrong.\nI haven't lost to anyone yet. So, I won't\nbe doing any self-reflecting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652580"
msgid "And like, playing this part has been kinda fun.\nSort of feels like I'm a boss. Looking down\non peeps is the best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652696"
msgid "I can't believe this… It's as if she feels no remorse.\nAlthough, it's obvious that she's acting tough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652800"
msgid "I thought #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind was wide-open at this point,\nbut it looks like it won't be so easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652908"
msgid "―――Guess I have to do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652940"
msgid "It truly pains me to do this,\nbut if this is how it's going to be,\nthen this calls for the usual rough therapy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653052"
msgid "W-what is it?\nPhysical attacks do nothing here.\nNothing has any effect on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653132"
msgid "I got no weaknesses in the first place.\nI AM the No. 1 Game Champ. I've only been\nmessing with 10% of my full power so far!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653256"
msgid "This \"boss\" has some nerve saying that,\nwith all the weaknesses she's got…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653332"
msgid "This is her first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has a bad habit of―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "653420"
msgid "Compulsively Gigantic"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "653444"
msgid "Compulsively Big Breasted"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653472"
msgid "What's this \"compulsively gigantic\" about?\nA gigantic body? Being a giant?\nAm I some over 180cm tall Russian beauty?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653592"
msgid "Hah. The only things allowed to be big are\nmeat and game install sizes. Giantesses?\nDon't make me giga-laugh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653704"
msgid "…damn, I messed up since the words\nlooked kind of similar…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653768"
msgid "\"I love them,\" was what I was about to say,\nuntil I took some damage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653840"
msgid "…this isn't the time to be divulging MY preferences.\nI need to divulge #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's bad habit.\nI know how you feel, but let's keep this to ourselves.\nThe right answer is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654032"
msgid "W-what's the deal here!? Why is thunder shooting\nout!? And why are my clothes conveniently\nthe only thing getting torn apart!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654160"
msgid "Ah… What is this…? So hot…\nMy entire body is tingling…\nMy chest… My chest, hurts…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654252"
msgid "Heh heh heh.\n#[Let this be][This is]# your punishment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654308"
msgid "Only those who have been through this phenomenon understand it.\nI guess #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had no idea how dangerous \na \"cross-examination within one's mind\" can be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654480"
msgid "But this is a world of mental images;\na space where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's most hated \"lecturing\" has power!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654592"
msgid "Awawa! No one told me, no one told me\nabout THIS…! #C236196003BB#CDEF, you liar! You said all I had\nto do was lock #[him][her]# in――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654732"
msgid "All I said were a few words, and now she's in a panic.\nBeing a boss is fun? What a joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654824"
msgid "There's no reason why #C236196003Jinako#CDEF would serve as a boss, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654900"
msgid "Bosses are lonely creatures.\nThey're always wishing to ride alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654968"
msgid "It's unlikely that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF could endure such a position.\nThat's because #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is afraid of―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "655100"
msgid "Traveling Alone"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "655116"
msgid "Eating Yakiniku Alone"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655140"
msgid "I don't go on trips in the first place.\nNo friends, but I don't have the courage to go\noutside, anyway. That's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655284"
msgid "Gah… Damn, I jumped the gun there.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is afraid of something more fundamental than that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655396"
msgid "What's wrong with going out for yakiniku alone!?\nThat's proof of being a winner,\none of my few real-life skills!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655512"
msgid "In reality, going out for yakiniku alone just shows that you're\nlonely. You grill, then eat; grill, then eat―a human thermal\npower station that releases out heat with a *fwoom*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655692"
msgid "It's a sanctuary of loneliness.\nNo way I can rashly intrude on that―――\nI shouldn't press any further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655800"
msgid "I apologize to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF from the bottom of my heart\nand choose the correct phrasing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655900"
msgid "I'm alone anyway, DUMMY! How many years do you\nthink I spent being a NEET!? Don't underestimate\nan almost thirty-year-old fujoshi! DIE!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656036"
msgid "But I can't let up on her now.\nThere's a reason why she became like this.\nIt's the dark shadow cast over #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656184"
msgid "The reason why #C236196003Jinako#CDEF locked herself in her room―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "656256"
msgid "The Fujoshi Curse"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "656276"
msgid "The Curse of Death"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656296"
msgid "The fujoshi curse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656316"
msgid "With wicked intent, they ship together characters\nof a story with no real relation and without a premise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656424"
msgid "Any woman, for no reason at all, can become a fujoshi."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656480"
msgid "She likes it, she keeps getting worse, and deep down\nshe desires it―this is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's \"curse on herself.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656604"
msgid "It's the last thing that's ruining her―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656652"
msgid "Hey. Don't bash me like you know it all. You're\nan amateur that knows nothing of the wonders\nof shipping and tasteful situations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656784"
msgid "This is all outside the realm of normal\nhuman brain function. It's on a whole different\nlevel. Has nothing to do with \"trauma.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656912"
msgid "I-I took a fierce counter…\nLooks like it wasn't trauma that I ended up touching on,\nbut rather conviction―and an absolutely\nunyielding conviction at that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657072"
msgid "…let's start from the beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657108"
msgid "The reason why #C236196003Jinako#CDEF locked herself in her room―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657180"
msgid "The Curse of Death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657200"
msgid "Her parents, who had committed no crime\nand had done nothing wrong, passed away in an accident."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657296"
msgid "Death falls on everyone, for no reason at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657344"
msgid "Doubting that, being afraid of that,\nand detesting that from the bottom of her heart\nis #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's \"curse on herself.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657480"
msgid "That's the final trauma that keeps her tied down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657532"
msgid "…mean… you're so mean…\nYou not only took me down, you even drove my\nmind up against the wall…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657632"
msgid "No… I don't like this…\nEnough! Fine, I'll die! I'll die in the\nend anyway, so I'll die here and now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657736"
msgid "…we can't have that happen.\nEspecially now that #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's name was brought up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657832"
msgid "I'm stubborn, too.\nNow that we've hit this point, I'm going to do everything\nI can to get #C236196003Jinako#CDEF back on her feet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657964"
msgid "I take a deep breath and… one, two:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658004"
msgid "Hyoow! You're so MEAN! No attack has ever\nshocked me like that one! You monster!\nYou demon! You butcher's shopkeeper!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658124"
msgid "Still… You're, right…\nI have a baby face; none of the appeal of\nan adult… I don't diet anymore…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658224"
msgid "What else could one call this body but \"flab\"…\nI'm a waste of a heroine, aren't I…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658312"
msgid "#ROFS0002#RUBS     Srs #RUBESeriously#REND!? Wow! #C236196003Jinako#CDEF must be a winner!\nAs the sweet, older-lady character that I am―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658452"
msgid "Hyooow! Soz～! I got ahead of myself!\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, you've got one scary look\nin your eyes, yo!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658560"
msgid "I'm sorry I'm sorry,\nI'm sorry my breasts are so big,\nI'm sorry for the pointless sex appeal…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658656"
msgid "So please forgive me\nI'll stop getting ahead of myself,\nI promise------!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658732"
msgid "…sorry I'm such a screw-up of an older-lady.\nYou're trying to cheer me up… but…\nIt's no use."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658828"
msgid "I have no confidence in myself.\nI can't forgive myself.\nEven if I get away from #C236196003BB#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658932"
msgid "Even if I go back to the school building, I'll\nalways act the same way. Are you fine with that?\nYou do understand that I'm not useful, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659076"
msgid "This is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's true voice.\nNot her Compulsive Lying, Loneliness, or Curse of Death talking:\nit's her true sorrows."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659212"
msgid "I can't understand #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's suffering.\nThat's why I can't make her problems go away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659316"
msgid "…there's only one thing I can do, one thing I can say:\nmy feelings towards #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659416"
msgid "…no can do.\nIf I was able to look at my well-being,\nmy life wouldn't have turned out this way…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659516"
msgid "…I see… Making someone take responsibility for themselves\nis too sudden a thing to ask when they've lost confidence…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659636"
msgid "The end result may seem the same,\nbut this isn't the way to express this.\nWhat I should say is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659740"
msgid "There are many kinds of personalities among people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659792"
msgid "I won't say \"always have hope.\"\nOne is free to do that whenever. One can even be pessimistic.\nEveryone feels lost, troubled, in want of someone to\nlean on sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659960"
msgid "The one thing I want is for her not to get complacent.\nAfter all―――#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is so #ROFS0004#RUBSlewd#RUBEfat#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660092"
msgid "I'm tickled by the yellow \"ruby\" text,\nbut sheesh～ Are you calling me a sow?\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF? A SOW!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660204"
msgid "…I wrapped things up with a smooth line,\nbut this pork tenderloin here just won't tender up…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660300"
msgid "Anyway, no more blaming ourselves, got it!?\nI'll keep humiliating #C236196003Jinako#CDEF until she agrees…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660412"
msgid "Ugh, fine I lost～～! I'll make an effort!\nIn my own way I'll make a pico-sized effort,\nso please―please stop BULLYING ME!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660536"
msgid "#C080080080The world goes white, along with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF#C080080080's whimpers.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660632"
msgid "#C080080080I get the impression that I'm becoming lighter.\nWith #C236196003Jinako#CDEF#C080080080's mind unraveled, the Relief must be crumbling.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660784"
msgid "Too bad, so sad. Sucks, but you've gone\nover the limit. I ain't scared of\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF aaaat all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660892"
msgid "What's your deal, anyway. You're the lowest of\nthe lowest chump there is. Are you a slime?\nA she-slime? A dot?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661004"
msgid "And why are we suddenly joking around?\nIs #C236196003Jinako#CDEF really that awful of a heroine? Well,\nwhatever. I'm getting my payback in full."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661152"
msgid "This is proof that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind has completely closed off."
msgstr ""

